WEBVTT

00:13:28.608 --> 00:13:31.905
Pra pyetja me ate te se ciles nisa kete diskutim,

00:13:31.905 --> 00:13:35.105
cila mendoni se eshte me e veshtire per tu perballuar,

00:13:35.105 --> 00:13:38.062
qeveria shtypese apo shoqeria shtypese?

00:13:38.062 --> 00:13:40.961
Shpresoj se do te gjeni celesin drejt pergjigjes nga fjalimi im.

00:13:40.961 --> 00:13:42.417
Faleminderit,te gjitheve.

00:13:42.417 --> 00:13:47.185
(Duartrokitje)

00:13:47.185 --> 00:13:50.309
Faleminderit.

00:13:50.309 --> 00:13:55.993
(Duartrokitje)

00:13:55.993 --> 00:13:59.517
Faleminderit.(Duartrokitje)